stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created
    Created --> Funded: buyer fund(exact price)
    Created --> Cancelled: both approve cancellation
    Funded --> Released: buyer release
    Funded --> Disputed: buyer/seller dispute
    Disputed --> ResolvedToBuyer: arbiter resolves buyer
    Disputed --> ResolvedToSeller: arbiter resolves seller
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Released --> [*]
    ResolvedToBuyer --> [*]
    ResolvedToSeller --> [*]
    note right of Released: seller may withdraw credit
